// Audio settings.
//
// ra_audio: "Use original Red Alert audio" (WP11.7). Off by default; the CC0
// sounds of assets/audio/bank.ron always work. When on, the sounds named in
// assets/audio/ra_mapping.ron are read from the player's own Red Alert files
// under `path` (the install directory or the freeware download; MIX archives
// are searched a few directory levels deep). Missing or broken files fall back
// to the CC0 sounds with one warning. `sf_game --ra-audio <path>` turns it on
// for one run.
(
    ra_audio: (
        enabled: false,
        path: "",
    ),
)
